{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天午休时，濑名同学依然主动\\n来到了我们这边。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "今天午休时，濑名同学依然主动来到了我们这边。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "结女校学生Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学，从昨天起就在和\\n　瓜生他们一起吃饭呢～……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「濑名同学，从昨天起就在和　瓜生他们一起吃饭呢～……」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0028", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——似乎全班人都已经意识到了这种变化。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "——似乎全班人都已经意识到了这种变化。", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难道是心境有什么变化了吗？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jb0017", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "结女校学生Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯不过，总之气氛轻松了很多。\\n　老实说之前的濑名同学好可怕……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「嗯不过，总之气氛轻松了很多。　老实说之前的濑名同学好可怕……」", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0029", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「盯……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "结女校学生Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，什、什么都没有哦呵呵呵呵！」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0030", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学曾态度强硬，始终反对并校。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而开始接受我们的结女校的女生，\\n也难免会有些在意濑名同学吧。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "而开始接受我们的结女校的女生，也难免会有些在意濑名同学吧。", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在各种意义上她都是结女校的代表。\\n以我的感觉，她就像是“窗”。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "在各种意义上她都是结女校的代表。以我的感觉，她就像是“窗”。", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由此导致的难题，到上周为止都还存在着——", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "由此导致的难题，到上周为止都还存在着——", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都事到如今了，也只能去适应了啊。\\n　保持模糊不清也只会让人感到不安……」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "「都事到如今了，也只能去适应了啊。　保持模糊不清也只会让人感到不安……」", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管如何，她变成了这样，\\n教室的氛围也会变得轻松一些。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": "不管如何，她变成了这样，教室的氛围也会变得轻松一些。", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过不过，爱理终于\\n　觉醒了人的温柔呢」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "「不过不过，爱理终于　觉醒了人的温柔呢」", "plain_idx": 296, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0062", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，乾同学开始安抚那些被濑名同学盯着的学生。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "然后，乾同学开始安抚那些被濑名同学盯着的学生。", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到刚才为止，她还一直在粘着过来玩的天羽学姐。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说什么呢纱凪，把我说得那么冷酷无情」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀——这周之前的爱理就像北风一样呢？\\n　不过，现在有种终于要追上我了的感觉？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「哎呀——这周之前的爱理就像北风一样呢？　不过，现在有种终于要追上我了的感觉？」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0063", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔，纱纱居高临下的视线！」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0261", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，那纱纱就是太阳公公了呢？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0159", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜？溜～」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0055", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，小乾对人很友善，\\n　濑名同学这方面确实有点不行啊～」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": "「不过，小乾对人很友善，　濑名同学这方面确实有点不行啊～」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0154", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「盯」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在确实正刮着北风」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼。随你们说」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学生气地扭过头去。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一边，乾同学则越发得意地挺起胸膛。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以你想说什么，纱凪？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「待人温柔……对男生也是一样……\\n　果然这样才对啊，我是这么想的。\\n　爱理也终于明白了」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「待人温柔……对男生也是一样……　果然这样才对啊，我是这么想的。　爱理也终于明白了」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0064", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔！原来如此啊！\\n　关于这一点，还请您再详细地说说看～」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "「喔喔！原来如此啊！　关于这一点，还请您再详细地说说看～」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0262", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吧是吧？不过，也是呢～……」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0065", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁的火上浇油，使得乾同学兴头高涨。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理最近和美羽学姐关系也很好，\\n　果然这可以说是多亏了美羽学姐呢！」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": "「爱理最近和美羽学姐关系也很好，　果然这可以说是多亏了美羽学姐呢！」", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0066", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦，我做了什么吗？」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0160", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话题突然甩到美羽学姐的身上，让她瞪大了眼睛。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讨～厌～你在说什么啊～\\n　爱理这种改变绝对是受到了漂浮在美羽学姐周围的、\\n　温柔且美好的时空的影响哦～♪」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「讨～厌～你在说什么啊～　爱理这种改变绝对是受到了漂浮在美羽学姐周围的、　温柔且美好的时空的影响哦～♪」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 56, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0067", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于那句台词，濑名同学面色冷漠——", "text_idx": 348, "plain": "对于那句台词，濑名同学面色冷漠——", "plain_idx": 348, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是最喜欢天羽学姐的乾同学，\\n从一开始就对我们男生特别友好。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "但是最喜欢天羽学姐的乾同学，从一开始就对我们男生特别友好。", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学是受到了天羽学姐的影响而性格变得温柔……这样的话，\\n也不难理解。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": "濑名同学是受到了天羽学姐的影响而性格变得温柔……这样的话，也不难理解。", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
