{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生要是能加入，那就太好了，\\n　我真的是这么想的哦？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": "「瓜生要是能加入，那就太好了，　我真的是这么想的哦？」", "plain_idx": 388, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0166", "char_id": "みう"}]}
