{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我实在是有点被惊到，僵住了。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……之前那个友好的乾同学，\\n在我面前一下变了脸，对男人的厌恶全都释放了出来……", "text_idx": 413, "plain": "……之前那个友好的乾同学，在我面前一下变了脸，对男人的厌恶全都释放了出来……", "plain_idx": 414, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
