{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，不如说真亏她能坚持到今天为止……\\n　毕竟这么讨厌男人……」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "「不过，不如说真亏她能坚持到今天为止……　毕竟这么讨厌男人……」", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
