{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，谢谢你帮忙照顾小熊喵，\\n　瓜生」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": "「啊，谢谢你帮忙照顾小熊喵，　瓜生」", "plain_idx": 451, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0169", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事没事」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你怎么在这里啊，快给我消失，滚滚滚！\\n　别打扰我和美羽学姐的甜蜜时光，你这个讨厌的家伙」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": "「你怎么在这里啊，快给我消失，滚滚滚！　别打扰我和美羽学姐的甜蜜时光，你这个讨厌的家伙」", "plain_idx": 455, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0080", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最重要的是天羽学姐对我的态度丝毫没变，\\n而乾同学还是一直粘着学姐……", "text_idx": 457, "plain": "最重要的是天羽学姐对我的态度丝毫没变，而乾同学还是一直粘着学姐……", "plain_idx": 458, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，立场虽然变了，\\n但似乎处境并没有太大的变化，倒也无所谓了。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": "所以，立场虽然变了，但似乎处境并没有太大的变化，倒也无所谓了。", "plain_idx": 460, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看、看什么啊，\\n　难道是迷上我了？\\n　男人一看见可爱的女生就会这样子，啊——讨厌讨厌」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": "「看、看什么啊，　难道是迷上我了？　男人一看见可爱的女生就会这样子，啊——讨厌讨厌」", "plain_idx": 462, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0081", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，并不是那样」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是在说我不可爱吗！」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0082", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，也不是那样」", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到底是哪样，呆子！说得清楚点！」", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0083", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐，瓜生那个混蛋家伙\\n　总是说些含糊其辞的话来欺负我～」", "text_idx": 470, "plain": "「美羽学姐，瓜生那个混蛋家伙　总是说些含糊其辞的话来欺负我～」", "plain_idx": 471, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0084", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，你们两个都很有趣呢」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0170", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们的对话反而比以前还要多了。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": "我们的对话反而比以前还要多了。", "plain_idx": 475, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算了……或许这样也挺好的吧」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学也不再勉强自己，\\n改用很自然的方式对待我。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": "乾同学也不再勉强自己，改用很自然的方式对待我。", "plain_idx": 478, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，你到底要在这里待多久啊。\\n　说真的你赶紧给我消失吧，干脆从这个世界上消失吧！」", "text_idx": 479, "plain": "「不是，你到底要在这里待多久啊。　说真的你赶紧给我消失吧，干脆从这个世界上消失吧！」", "plain_idx": 480, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0085", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要我还活着，\\n　就绝对不会让你这样的混蛋家伙靠近学姐的——！」", "text_idx": 482, "plain": "「只要我还活着，　就绝对不会让你这样的混蛋家伙靠近学姐的——！」", "plain_idx": 483, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0086", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过，果然还是前途坎坷啊。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
